  "body": "This example: https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/sections.html#article-example contains this code:\r\n\r\n```HTML\r\n<h1>Comments</h1>\r\n  <article itemprop=\"comment\" itemscope itemtype=\"http://schema.org/UserComments\" id=\"c1\">\r\n```\r\nHowever, `UserComments` has been superseded - https://schema.org/UserComments#supersededby\r\n\r\nRunning through the example through https://validator.schema.org/ says\r\n\r\n> UserComments is not a known valid target type for the comment property.\r\n\r\nI'd suggest changing the comment to use /Comment - which will also necessitate changing the `commentTime` to `dateCreated`\r\n\r\n```HTML\r\n  <article itemprop=\"comment\" itemscope itemtype=\"https://schema.org/Comment\" id=\"c1\">\r\n   <link itemprop=\"url\" href=\"#c1\">\r\n   <footer>\r\n    <p>Posted by: <span itemprop=\"creator\" itemscope itemtype=\"http://schema.org/Person\">\r\n     <span itemprop=\"name\">George Washington</span>\r\n    </span></p>\r\n    <p><time itemprop=\"dateCreated\" datetime=\"2009-10-10\">15 minutes ago</time></p>\r\n   </footer>\r\n   <p>Yeah! Especially when talking about your lobbyist friends!</p>\r\n  </article>\r\n```",
